## JLO owns (G0 onward)

- Migrations: `gift_fulfilment_centres`, `gift_pool_inventory`, product gift flags
- Admin hub management + pool assignment UI
- Gift catalog / builder / order APIs
- Gift ops dashboard (G2+)
